<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-11-22T16:30:00.040Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 16:30:00 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Bandits are threatening to block roads and levy fees in Zamfara ahead of the 2027 elections, while armed gangs continue attacks across central Nigeria, killing civilians in villages, a mining site in Plateau, and a mosque in Niger state. Military personnel were accused of opening fire on civilians in Gombe, and gunmen in military uniforms killed a 60-year-old security guard in Plateau. ISWAP suffered a major loss with a Shura Council member and top commanders killed as troops repelled an attack in Borno. A funeral-bound boat capsized in southern Nigeria, killing at least 24 people. The conflict recorded 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxQZG5kNWlmcEZkU1FwejJfVUlPR3hKT3NqSngzMXBncG01NjhoUl9xUGs5V19yWGs5WDFJaE9qV01tZTM3aVZpOE5FOEVLQ1lCbDRSX0VXU1F4aVFjTUdJT1UyV0hTOFZtTzNvVFI1cnFWdnJFNWJLZGlDakFUVW1ZWkxKUkNZYVhVSEN5dDc3WXlqaGs0Q3d2QzdUUmR6QzlCTDhIeWVGT2VyZHRHODFGQWl1R0lidw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxPaDByaC1RTTBRbHFNMkhUbnFMbm9zMGNYZG1fT1ZUX1BIUWxqZmVRYUt6SC1PNk9TdUVoX0pLWTF1NEdKcTY4WXJpX0tFaVA0QmFfQ0V4MjZOb3BDS3VYdjU3NjlhSXpPUFdVTmk4aE4xa3BjMHdjX0ZSWkdfU1N3Ukt1c29MTlpTQ0stbllzTHZERjVPNVhsbG84bWQzeTI1MVdWOEVvOHIwU0JzM1pPX3J3SlhjSjRPZEphekdySE1aYjBu?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sahara Reporters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Vanguard News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilwFBVV95cUxNRFc5OHcxbFFZQVNReHpvMFkzMDNMeHhHTkVXcmVZTVhzd2Y4Z3JXS0JfOTRadVRVSGxOUTVQeFZ5XzZKcE5uM1VyS2xBRGN0a2NOeUx1alN0YXRTZjRQQWF5eTA5SzY3Q1VHNGtxX1hza1Z1Zmh4Sy1yVmFMT25zTG1pUkJaUFNyUDdBZ1hBbXVVdkEwejFR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Head Topics&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMie0FVX3lxTE5TRH